WEBVTT

00:40.040 --> 00:41.958
MAX VOLCANO

00:42.042 --> 00:44.461
FRACTAL GEOMETRY

00:44.544 --> 00:46.713
EVERYTHING ABOUT SACRED GEOMETRY

00:46.796 --> 00:48.715
AUDI AND BMW
3D GEOMETRY

00:55.847 --> 00:57.682
You're a shitty brother.

00:58.767 --> 00:59.601
Crap!

01:04.397 --> 01:06.524
You didn't go to the interview
I set up again?

01:10.236 --> 01:14.032
I begged the company for it.
You should really show up, for my sake.

01:16.117 --> 01:18.286
Did I ask you to go and set it up?

01:19.412 --> 01:21.664
Dad said this is the last time
he's helping.

01:23.041 --> 01:25.460
He told me not to help you
look for a job anymore, either.

01:25.960 --> 01:28.505
I never asked for your help.

01:28.588 --> 01:29.964
But you need it.

01:30.965 --> 01:32.717
You're a parasite in this house.

01:35.845 --> 01:37.055
Fine, okay.

01:37.138 --> 01:38.515
I'll leave then.

01:39.516 --> 01:41.893
If only we could reboot reality.

01:44.896 --> 01:47.065
You were better when Mom was alive.

02:04.082 --> 02:05.291
Ryohei.

02:06.417 --> 02:08.920
I don't need you
causing trouble for your brother.

02:16.469 --> 02:18.346
RESIDENCE

02:33.945 --> 02:37.365
CHOTA SEGAWA, DAIKICHI KARUBE

02:38.449 --> 02:40.368
ARISU: CAN I GO TO THE BAR?

02:44.789 --> 02:46.374
ARISU: I'M OFFICIALLY HOMELESS.

03:11.482 --> 03:12.609
Oh, Mr. Boss, sir.

03:12.692 --> 03:14.319
- How are ya?
- Oh, it's Karube. You're in early today.

03:14.402 --> 03:15.987
Uh…

03:16.070 --> 03:18.031
I just decided to come in a bit earlier.

03:18.114 --> 03:19.741
Why are you here at this hour, Kazu?

03:19.824 --> 03:21.576
I have something to take care of.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.077
Whoa!

03:27.957 --> 03:30.043
ARISU: KARUBE, YOU THERE?

03:31.169 --> 03:32.378
KARUBE

03:34.547 --> 03:36.716
How dare you put your hands
on someone else's woman!

03:36.799 --> 03:38.468
Stop it!

03:38.551 --> 03:40.136
Shut up, bitch!

03:44.182 --> 03:46.184
I feel better now.

03:58.905 --> 04:05.203
ARISU: CHOTA, YOU WORKING?
LET ME STAY OVER.

04:07.247 --> 04:11.376
CHOTA

04:21.261 --> 04:22.178
Here you go.

04:22.262 --> 04:23.137
Ah!

04:23.805 --> 04:26.641
I'm sorry that you have to do this
when you're so busy, Chota.

04:26.724 --> 04:29.602
This money will really help us out.

04:29.686 --> 04:31.604
Let's make this the last time, okay?

04:33.439 --> 04:35.400
What do you mean, the last time?

04:36.818 --> 04:40.780
ARISU: HEY, ARE YOU GUYS IGNORING ME?

04:41.281 --> 04:43.324
Don't you understand,
the air here in Tokyo

04:43.408 --> 04:46.035
is being polluted every day
by the powers of industry?

04:46.119 --> 04:48.663
We need to make it clean again!

04:48.746 --> 04:52.041
Here, here, there.
Everything has to be reclaimed!

04:52.125 --> 04:53.960
Yeah, I get it already!

04:55.128 --> 04:56.629
I'm late.

04:56.713 --> 04:57.755
Thank you!

05:03.094 --> 05:04.929
ARISU: FINE.

05:20.778 --> 05:23.781
KARUBE: I WAS FIRED FROM MY JOB.

05:28.244 --> 05:30.621
Karube's timing really sucks.

05:32.040 --> 05:33.499
ARISU: SERIOUSLY? WHEN?

05:33.583 --> 05:37.754
KARUBE: RIGHT NOW. I'M JOBLESS NOW!

05:37.837 --> 05:40.465
ARISU: SERIOUSLY? WHEN?
KARUBE: RIGHT NOW. I'M JOBLESS NOW!

05:40.548 --> 05:46.804
CHOTA: GOOD JOB GETTING FIRED.
I'M SKIPPING WORK RIGHT NOW.

05:48.139 --> 05:52.060
KARUBE: YOU SHOULD WORK, CHOTA.
YOU'RE POOR.

05:54.395 --> 05:56.522
ARISU: I LEFT HOME.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.400
CHOTA: GOOD WORK.

05:59.484 --> 06:01.402
ARISU: I NEED A DRINK.

06:01.486 --> 06:03.029
CHOTA: ME TOO!

06:03.112 --> 06:04.989
KARUBE: LET'S GO, THEN!

06:05.073 --> 06:07.992
ARISU: GO FIND A JOB, KARUBE.

06:08.076 --> 06:09.660
CHOTA: YOU TOO, ARISU.

06:11.162 --> 06:14.749
KARUBE: OKAY,
LET'S MEET IN FRONT OF SHIBUYA STATION.

06:14.832 --> 06:16.667
ARISU: OKAY!

06:16.751 --> 06:17.585
CHOTA: OKAY!

06:17.668 --> 06:18.586
Whoa!

06:21.547 --> 06:23.591
ARISU: I STEPPED ON SOMEONE'S VOMIT.

06:23.674 --> 06:26.135
CHOTA: GOOD JOB STEPPING ON VOMIT.

06:41.484 --> 06:44.654
ARISU: I'M HAVING THE WORST DAY.

06:45.655 --> 06:46.906
CHOTA: ME TOO.

06:46.989 --> 06:48.616
KARUBE: SAME.

06:48.699 --> 06:54.705
ARISU: I JUST DON'T FEEL LIKE I'VE BEEN
DOING MY BEST SINCE THIS MORNING.

06:56.582 --> 06:59.585
KARUBE:
ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT YOUR GAME?

07:03.297 --> 07:06.259
ARISU: FOUND YOU, KARUBE!

07:06.342 --> 07:08.010
FIND YOUR NEW SELF

07:08.094 --> 07:10.388
KARUBE: HEY!

07:10.471 --> 07:12.181
CHOTA: HEY!

07:12.265 --> 07:14.767
ARISU: HEY.

07:16.269 --> 07:17.520
Hey, we're right here.

07:18.855 --> 07:20.398
You wanna go get a drink?

07:20.982 --> 07:23.151
It's early. Not many bars open.

07:23.234 --> 07:24.402
Man.

07:25.820 --> 07:28.197
That settles that,
guess we're going to a mall again.

07:34.245 --> 07:36.581
I'd be down with going to
a deserted island.

07:40.751 --> 07:43.588
I'd be down with zombies
showing up in Shibuya.

07:43.671 --> 07:46.382
Everyone here gets bitten,
and they all turn into zombies.

07:46.466 --> 07:48.926
Stop it with the zombie talk, will ya?

07:49.010 --> 07:52.054
If zombies did show up here,
only Karube would survive.

07:52.138 --> 07:54.557
You'd knock 'em out with one punch.

07:54.640 --> 07:56.100
I doubt that.

07:56.184 --> 07:57.894
You'd be the one to survive, Arisu.

07:57.977 --> 07:59.479
Me? Why's that?

08:00.938 --> 08:03.107
Because I know you'd outsmart 'em.

08:06.903 --> 08:09.697
Arisu, free advice…

08:11.574 --> 08:14.619
You should stop hanging out with us
and go live your life.

08:16.412 --> 08:17.663
You should do it.

08:19.248 --> 08:20.416
Huh?

08:21.042 --> 08:22.376
What's with him?

09:16.389 --> 09:17.723
Shit, let's do this.

09:17.807 --> 09:18.808
- Come on!
- Whoa…

09:18.891 --> 09:20.935
- What are you doing?
- Whoa…

09:21.018 --> 09:22.770
This is the first day
of your independence!

09:22.853 --> 09:24.105
Shut up, take a picture!

09:24.188 --> 09:26.023
- Okay!
- Oh…

09:26.107 --> 09:27.650
- Comin' through!
- Whoa!

09:27.733 --> 09:28.985
Step aside!

09:29.068 --> 09:31.529
- Hey, this is dangerous!
- Give way!

09:31.612 --> 09:32.697
Hey, hey!

09:32.780 --> 09:35.199
Hey, wait! Let me take a picture!

09:35.283 --> 09:36.200
Whoa!

09:36.284 --> 09:37.743
Wait, what are you doing?

09:37.827 --> 09:38.869
Turn towards me!

09:38.953 --> 09:40.830
Hey! Stop, no pictures!

09:40.913 --> 09:43.207
- Big smile, big smile!
- Look here, look here!

09:43.291 --> 09:45.084
Come on, Arisu!

09:45.167 --> 09:46.836
- Here, look at the camera!
- I'm sorry, everyone!…

09:46.919 --> 09:49.213
Stop, dammit! Fuck!

09:49.297 --> 09:51.882
Now that's a good face!

10:04.520 --> 10:05.896
Oh…

10:08.024 --> 10:09.734
That is perfect!

10:09.817 --> 10:11.611
Whoo!

10:11.694 --> 10:12.903
Great!

10:19.619 --> 10:21.245
Shibuya!

10:22.246 --> 10:23.789
You rock!

10:26.125 --> 10:27.710
Oh, get off! Get off!

10:27.793 --> 10:29.211
Put me down. Whoa…

10:29.295 --> 10:30.838
Come on. Quick, quick, quick.

10:30.921 --> 10:33.507
You guys are crazy!

10:35.259 --> 10:37.345
Watch out! Look out!

10:37.428 --> 10:38.888
Hurry up!

10:38.971 --> 10:40.139
Look, fireworks!

10:40.222 --> 10:41.682
Run for your lives!

10:43.601 --> 10:45.061
Moron!

10:46.729 --> 10:49.148
Guys, wa-- wait.

10:49.231 --> 10:50.316
It's the cops!

10:50.399 --> 10:52.234
- Whoa! Go, go, go…
- We'll be in trouble!

10:52.318 --> 10:53.361
Let's get out of here!

10:54.695 --> 10:55.905
Run! Run!

11:04.538 --> 11:05.998
- The stairs!
- Yeah!

11:06.957 --> 11:08.793
- Whoa!
- Oh, watch out!

11:08.876 --> 11:10.961
- Head for the john!
- Turn around! Turn around!

11:11.545 --> 11:12.755
Sorry!

11:15.383 --> 11:17.259
Go, go, go!

11:19.095 --> 11:20.471
- Let me lock it. Gimme a second.
- Come on.

11:20.554 --> 11:23.057
- Just hurry it up, for fuck's sake!
- Damn!

11:38.906 --> 11:40.783
CHOTA: WHO FARTED?

11:46.747 --> 11:49.500
CHOTA: WHO WAS IT?
OWN UP AND SNIFF UP YOUR OWN FART!

11:51.669 --> 11:53.170
It was you, right?

12:14.442 --> 12:15.901
I don't hear anything.

12:32.334 --> 12:33.669
I'll go check it out.

12:33.753 --> 12:34.670
All right.

12:35.337 --> 12:37.256
- Be careful.
- Yeah, okay.

15:29.553 --> 15:31.096
Jesus.

17:17.786 --> 17:18.704
Baby?

17:24.710 --> 17:25.794
Baby?

17:39.808 --> 17:43.729
WHERE'S THE FILE?!
GET YOUR ACT TOGETHER!! - TAKAGI

19:14.778 --> 19:16.655
What the fuck?

19:45.809 --> 19:47.186
Hey!

19:50.355 --> 19:51.732
Hello?

19:57.196 --> 19:58.655
Anyone there?

20:06.288 --> 20:07.581
Hello?

20:32.314 --> 20:33.440
Seen anyone?

20:33.523 --> 20:34.524
No!

20:36.068 --> 20:37.152
See anybody?

20:37.778 --> 20:39.404
There's no one anywhere!

20:45.410 --> 20:47.788
Even my phone isn't working.

21:01.426 --> 21:03.637
Was there some kind of
evacuation drill today?

21:05.973 --> 21:07.307
Not that I know about.

21:09.142 --> 21:12.396
Some sort of event?
A flash mob, maybe?

21:13.063 --> 21:15.399
The scale of this
is way too big for that.

21:19.403 --> 21:21.780
What if it's only
the three of us left alive?

21:38.422 --> 21:40.632
This doesn't seem all that bad to me.

21:42.175 --> 21:43.135
What?

21:44.803 --> 21:46.221
Don't you find this exciting?

21:48.473 --> 21:49.850
You out of your mind?

21:52.019 --> 21:54.354
You're right. I think it's kinda cool.

21:54.438 --> 21:55.314
Why?

21:55.981 --> 21:58.275
'Cause I don't have to go to work.
That's good.

21:59.693 --> 22:01.111
Are you guys crazy?

22:01.194 --> 22:03.113
No one to be angry with us.

22:03.196 --> 22:05.449
And we can eat and drink
all we want, right?

22:07.159 --> 22:08.744
You'll be a virgin your whole life.

22:09.703 --> 22:12.456
Huh? Don't think I'd like that.

22:27.220 --> 22:29.806
Any virgins out there?

22:29.890 --> 22:31.141
You tryin' to scare 'em?

22:31.224 --> 22:32.976
I'd do it!

22:36.021 --> 22:39.149
- Isn't this great?
- Awesome! Whoo!

22:39.232 --> 22:40.942
- Guys.
- Arisu!

22:41.026 --> 22:42.903
Stop joking around, you guys!

22:42.986 --> 22:44.196
- Karube!
- Karube!

22:45.655 --> 22:47.074
- That hurts!
- Huh?

22:47.157 --> 22:49.159
Huh?

22:52.329 --> 22:53.497
Fuck.

23:00.670 --> 23:04.841
WELCOME, PLAYERS
THE GAME WILL COMMENCE IN A MOMENT

23:07.886 --> 23:10.597
WELCOME, PLAYERS.
THE GAME WILL COMMENCE IN A MOMENT

23:10.680 --> 23:11.640
Game?

23:19.398 --> 23:21.400
THIS WAY TO THE GAME ARENA

23:24.694 --> 23:26.154
- Over there.
- Hm?

23:28.156 --> 23:29.366
Lights?

23:29.950 --> 23:31.201
Somebody must be there.

23:33.787 --> 23:34.871
Let's go.

23:34.955 --> 23:35.831
Okay.

24:11.908 --> 24:18.915
GM BUILDING

24:30.969 --> 24:37.392
THE GAME ARENA IS UP AHEAD

25:36.910 --> 25:39.746
1 PER PERSON

25:59.015 --> 26:02.060
1 PER PERSON

26:18.243 --> 26:21.079
FACE RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT FOR A MOMENT

26:21.913 --> 26:23.206
It's got face recognition.

26:23.915 --> 26:25.166
Do we use these phones?

26:27.586 --> 26:28.920
There's no signal.

26:29.004 --> 26:31.631
The outgoing call function
is disabled.

26:32.132 --> 26:33.091
GAME
PLEASE WAIT

26:33.174 --> 26:35.218
Please wait
for the game to commence.

26:35.885 --> 26:38.680
Currently, there are three participants.

26:39.472 --> 26:43.018
One minute remaining
until registration closes.

26:43.101 --> 26:44.603
What the hell is this?

26:46.104 --> 26:47.147
A game.

26:48.273 --> 26:51.067
Huh… Finally, a person.

26:51.693 --> 26:54.154
Hey. Uh, do you know where everyone went?

27:11.421 --> 27:12.922
What the hell was that?

27:13.548 --> 27:14.758
A laser?

27:14.841 --> 27:15.675
CHOTA SEGAWA

27:15.759 --> 27:18.511
Cross the borderline,
and you'll never return.

27:19.804 --> 27:21.848
You have no choice but to play the game.

27:33.318 --> 27:34.361
- Whoa!
- Hey!

27:39.282 --> 27:41.409
You heard what she said.
Don't do it.

27:46.456 --> 27:48.041
Oh!

27:48.124 --> 27:50.001
I'm so relieved!

27:50.794 --> 27:53.046
Jeez, I thought there was no one else…

27:56.925 --> 27:58.635
My condolences.

28:07.352 --> 28:08.978
Registration is now closed.

28:09.688 --> 28:11.731
The game will now commence.

28:12.357 --> 28:13.316
Game?

28:14.234 --> 28:16.653
Game, "Dead or Alive".

28:16.736 --> 28:17.821
DEAD OR ALIVE

28:17.904 --> 28:20.407
Difficulty, Three of Clubs.

28:20.490 --> 28:22.242
Three of Clubs?

28:22.826 --> 28:23.910
What does that mean?

28:24.786 --> 28:26.246
Rule.

28:26.329 --> 28:30.166
Select the correct door
within the stipulated time frame.

28:30.834 --> 28:31.668
What?

28:31.751 --> 28:33.294
Clear condition.

28:33.378 --> 28:36.339
Leave the building within the time limit.

28:36.423 --> 28:37.966
LEAVE THE BUILDING
WITHIN THE TIME LIMIT.

28:39.551 --> 28:41.469
START

28:47.142 --> 28:48.852
You'll die if you just stand there.

28:58.153 --> 28:59.362
We have no choice.

29:20.425 --> 29:22.135
The time limit for this room…

29:22.218 --> 29:23.052
TIME LIMIT

29:23.136 --> 29:24.721
…is two minutes.

29:42.530 --> 29:43.698
What is this?

29:50.497 --> 29:51.331
LIVE

29:51.414 --> 29:52.665
Alive…

29:52.749 --> 29:53.583
DIE

29:53.666 --> 29:54.667
…or Dead.

29:56.669 --> 29:59.088
Is this really a game?

30:00.340 --> 30:04.177
I think… this is really getting exciting.

30:08.598 --> 30:11.184
I'm sure this must be
doors to an art gallery.

30:12.894 --> 30:15.980
I want to go… home.

30:16.689 --> 30:19.359
It'll be fine. You're with us.

30:19.442 --> 30:22.278
We'll play the game,
get our prize, and go home. Okay?

30:22.362 --> 30:24.030
Our prize?

30:24.113 --> 30:26.115
Yeah, I'm sure we're gonna get one.

30:26.199 --> 30:27.659
One minute remaining.

30:27.742 --> 30:28.827
Arisu.

30:29.452 --> 30:30.954
Which door do you think it is?

30:32.997 --> 30:35.917
Dead or Alive.

30:36.000 --> 30:38.086
Well, it can't be the skeleton, right?

30:40.255 --> 30:41.631
And if we choose the wrong door?

30:42.715 --> 30:43.967
The answer is "Alive".

30:44.050 --> 30:46.219
Open the door that says "Alive".

30:47.178 --> 30:48.263
How do you know?

30:48.847 --> 30:51.307
Because… obviously, it's the "Alive" door.

30:54.602 --> 30:55.812
Do you guys smell something?

30:55.895 --> 30:57.981
Oh, fuck!

31:00.567 --> 31:01.568
Is it a fire?

31:02.861 --> 31:05.446
- Thirty seconds remaining.
- The answer is "Alive"!

31:05.530 --> 31:07.574
- Hurry and open the door!
- Open it yourself!

31:07.657 --> 31:09.325
What'll happen if our time's up?

31:09.409 --> 31:11.035
We won't get more time. Hurry!

31:11.119 --> 31:12.453
Why do you think
it's the right one?

31:12.537 --> 31:14.831
'Cause we shouldn't
choose the "Dead" door, right?

31:14.914 --> 31:16.207
Twenty seconds remaining.

31:16.291 --> 31:18.293
I can't take it, I can't breathe!

31:28.761 --> 31:31.514
Is… she dead?

31:33.391 --> 31:35.435
Ten seconds remaining.

31:37.353 --> 31:39.230
DIE

31:39.314 --> 31:40.481
Five,

31:40.565 --> 31:42.734
four, three, two…

31:42.817 --> 31:44.319
- Chota!
- …one.

31:44.944 --> 31:46.738
Move!

31:48.114 --> 31:49.699
The time limit for this room

31:49.782 --> 31:52.035
is one minute and fifty seconds.

31:57.332 --> 31:59.000
She really is dead.

31:59.083 --> 32:00.376
What the hell is this?

32:01.252 --> 32:04.088
You were the one who killed that girl.

32:04.172 --> 32:06.591
But you guys survived
because of me, didn't you?

32:06.674 --> 32:07.508
What?

32:07.592 --> 32:08.885
Blame me all you want.

32:08.968 --> 32:11.137
If you guys don't think fast,
you're gonna die too.

32:13.222 --> 32:14.390
Damn it!

32:15.391 --> 32:17.685
Do we choose
the "Die" door now, huh?

32:17.769 --> 32:21.022
Since the last one was "Die"
the next one should be "Live".

32:21.105 --> 32:23.399
Yeah, but maybe
that's what they want us to think.

32:23.483 --> 32:26.194
- But it's hard to choose "Die".
- Wait a second.

32:26.277 --> 32:29.656
I think that this is a game
where we choose a sacrifice.

32:29.739 --> 32:30.615
A sacrifice?

32:30.698 --> 32:32.784
There's probably no difference
in the doors.

32:32.867 --> 32:34.535
What's important is who opens them.

32:34.619 --> 32:37.455
They want us to choose a person
within the time limit.

32:37.538 --> 32:39.123
You sacrificed that girl.

32:39.874 --> 32:41.376
Why don't you open the next door?

32:41.459 --> 32:44.504
Because I believe if I survive,
it'll be for the good of all mankind.

32:44.587 --> 32:47.006
Well, don't we feel good about ourselves?

32:48.466 --> 32:50.218
One minute has passed.

32:53.262 --> 32:55.390
No one will open a door at this rate.

32:55.473 --> 32:57.392
We're all gonna die in the fire
if time runs out!

32:57.475 --> 32:58.935
Then why don't you open it?

32:59.936 --> 33:01.854
You want me to open it,
why don't you do it yourself?

33:01.938 --> 33:03.481
You want someone else to open it!

33:11.280 --> 33:12.448
All right, I'll open it.

33:16.285 --> 33:17.120
Arisu!

33:17.203 --> 33:18.871
LIVE

33:19.998 --> 33:21.290
DIE

33:23.626 --> 33:25.545
Stop, Arisu. Don't listen to her!

33:27.630 --> 33:29.090
I'll open the door, fuck!

33:39.392 --> 33:41.144
Thirty seconds remaining.

33:48.609 --> 33:49.527
Arisu!

34:01.247 --> 34:04.167
See? Not so easy, is it?

34:04.250 --> 34:06.335
Even you would have sacrificed that girl!

34:06.419 --> 34:08.087
Shut the fuck up!

34:08.171 --> 34:09.922
Twenty seconds remaining.

34:10.965 --> 34:12.341
I'll do it.

34:12.425 --> 34:13.926
He's not very lucky, anyway.

34:14.010 --> 34:16.095
- Karube!
- We'll take turns.

34:19.265 --> 34:20.475
You'll go after me.

34:21.350 --> 34:22.852
Ten seconds remaining.

34:23.352 --> 34:24.187
Karube.

34:28.483 --> 34:29.650
Karube!

34:31.903 --> 34:32.987
Five,

34:33.071 --> 34:34.989
- four, three…
- Karube!

34:35.073 --> 34:36.699
- …two, one.
- Hurry!

34:40.703 --> 34:42.705
The time limit for this room

34:42.789 --> 34:44.874
is one minute and forty seconds.

34:46.084 --> 34:47.877
The time limit is shortening.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.587
I can't do this anymore.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.631
We're taking turns.

34:51.714 --> 34:53.007
You open the door next.

34:55.760 --> 34:57.929
- I'll choose the door.
- Wait.

34:58.012 --> 35:00.014
Go ahead and open.

35:00.098 --> 35:01.224
Open it!

35:02.433 --> 35:03.518
I can't.

35:09.107 --> 35:11.317
Arisu, what do you think?

35:11.901 --> 35:12.944
Think?

35:13.528 --> 35:16.280
You always say there are solutions
built into every game, right?

35:16.364 --> 35:18.616
- But this isn't a game.
- You can figure it out.

35:18.699 --> 35:21.702
You've always solved the puzzle games
that I could never figure out.

35:21.786 --> 35:24.622
- So do it!
- Karube, this is not a game.

35:25.164 --> 35:26.374
It's all about luck.

35:26.457 --> 35:28.709
- Arisu, just think!
- One minute has passed.

35:29.585 --> 35:31.045
Was there a clue somewhere?

35:31.963 --> 35:34.924
Think back.
Together, we came into this building…

35:35.007 --> 35:36.217
Remember the time limit!

35:36.300 --> 35:38.469
- And then, we went into the elevator--
- I won't do this!

35:38.553 --> 35:40.805
Don't give up, Arisu!
You can reboot this game!

35:40.888 --> 35:42.390
It's impossible, I'm telling you!

35:42.473 --> 35:44.559
- We're going to die.
- You're the gamer!

35:44.642 --> 35:47.687
While I was working my ass off,
you were sitting on a couch playing! Huh?

35:47.770 --> 35:49.105
You think that makes you better?

35:49.188 --> 35:50.982
The only thing you really know
is how to fight.

35:51.065 --> 35:53.109
- How is that better?
- Yeah? Well, I'll show you how.

35:53.192 --> 35:54.986
Stop it, Karube!

35:57.196 --> 35:58.698
GM BUILDING

35:58.781 --> 36:00.074
Wait.

36:02.910 --> 36:03.828
Wait a minute.

36:04.829 --> 36:06.747
Are you okay, Arisu?

36:11.169 --> 36:13.171
Thirty seconds remaining.

36:18.885 --> 36:20.303
BMW 523.

36:20.386 --> 36:21.262
Huh?

36:21.846 --> 36:23.306
It was a BMW 523.

36:23.931 --> 36:25.099
Yeah?

36:28.978 --> 36:30.062
The answer is "Die".

36:30.646 --> 36:32.773
- How do you know?
- Ten seconds remaining.

36:32.857 --> 36:34.192
We gotta hurry!

36:34.275 --> 36:35.651
I'll open it up.

36:35.735 --> 36:38.529
Arisu! Are you sure the answer is "Die"?

36:38.613 --> 36:39.488
Please…

36:39.572 --> 36:40.448
Five,

36:40.531 --> 36:41.782
four…

36:41.866 --> 36:42.867
…three…

36:42.950 --> 36:44.202
- This means I'm right!
- …two…

36:44.285 --> 36:45.578
…one.

36:47.705 --> 36:49.957
The time limit for this room

36:50.041 --> 36:52.460
- is one minute and thirty seconds.
- Where to next?

36:52.543 --> 36:53.961
Do you know which one this time?

36:55.046 --> 36:58.341
My father has a BMW 523.
It's 4 meters, 94 centimeters.

36:58.424 --> 37:00.426
One of 'em
was parked beside the building.

37:03.221 --> 37:05.765
The length of the building
is equivalent to four of those cars.

37:05.848 --> 37:09.393
This means that the building
is approximately 24 meters in length.

37:09.477 --> 37:12.897
And this room… If I measure with my feet,

37:12.980 --> 37:15.399
One, two, three…

37:17.443 --> 37:19.195
It should be around six meters.

37:20.404 --> 37:21.864
According to the evacuation map,

37:21.948 --> 37:23.950
the elevator
is at the corner of the building.

37:24.784 --> 37:26.035
1F EVACUATION ROUTE MAP

37:27.536 --> 37:29.455
The shape of the building
is square.

37:30.289 --> 37:31.916
This room is also square-shaped.

37:33.417 --> 37:35.378
Assuming that one side
of the building is 20 meters

37:35.461 --> 37:38.172
and the length of a single room
is 6 meters, that's three rooms a side.

37:38.256 --> 37:39.590
One minute has passed.

37:39.674 --> 37:41.175
- I need something to write on!
- Uh…

37:41.259 --> 37:43.094
- Here.
- Here, here, here, here, here.

37:45.471 --> 37:47.014
We're in a square building.

37:47.098 --> 37:49.350
Assuming that each room is square,

37:49.433 --> 37:51.686
this means that this floor has nine rooms.

37:51.769 --> 37:54.105
- It's just like a puzzle.
- Arisu's a genius at them.

37:54.188 --> 37:55.648
We started from this room.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.900
The high-school girl died…

37:57.984 --> 37:59.944
…in this room.

38:00.027 --> 38:02.571
Thanks to Karube, we moved forward.

38:02.655 --> 38:05.283
This means that the door to the right
cannot be accessed.

38:05.366 --> 38:07.368
Then I opened the door to this room.

38:07.451 --> 38:09.078
Thirty seconds remaining.

38:09.161 --> 38:12.373
By process of elimination, this room
and the one beside it can't be accessed.

38:12.456 --> 38:13.416
I'm sure of that.

38:13.499 --> 38:14.917
Ten seconds remaining.

38:15.001 --> 38:16.002
The answer is "Dead"!

38:16.085 --> 38:17.586
The "Alive" door is a trap!

38:17.670 --> 38:19.922
Four, three, two…

38:20.006 --> 38:21.465
…one.

38:24.093 --> 38:26.220
The time limit for this room

38:26.304 --> 38:28.097
is one minute and twenty seconds.

38:28.180 --> 38:30.099
If your reasoning is right,
we're gonna survive!

38:30.808 --> 38:31.851
You're awesome, Arisu!

38:32.601 --> 38:35.730
This game is not based on luck.
We need to clear it together!

38:35.813 --> 38:36.981
According to my drawing,

38:37.064 --> 38:39.150
- the next is also "Dead".
- Let's do it!

38:39.233 --> 38:40.234
Ah!

38:42.403 --> 38:44.322
- Ready?
- Uh-huh.

38:47.199 --> 38:49.327
Nice!

38:49.410 --> 38:50.369
Yeah, we did it!

38:50.453 --> 38:52.705
- The time limit for this room…
- What's next? Huh? Huh?

38:52.788 --> 38:54.123
…is one minute
and ten seconds.

38:56.667 --> 38:58.085
"Alive".

39:01.130 --> 39:01.964
Let's go.

39:06.802 --> 39:09.013
- Hey, that hurts!
- Huh?

39:09.096 --> 39:11.182
The time limit for this room
is one minute.

39:12.850 --> 39:14.101
There's no door here.

39:14.185 --> 39:16.312
- All right!
- Oh, yeah! Oh, yeah!

39:16.395 --> 39:18.230
- That hurts!
- Take this!

39:19.690 --> 39:20.941
So what's next?

39:28.115 --> 39:29.950
Since that door
is out of the question,

39:30.034 --> 39:31.577
should we choose one on the outer wall?

39:34.121 --> 39:35.748
Wait a second!

39:36.332 --> 39:39.335
- I might just have missed something.
- Fifty seconds remaining.

39:42.380 --> 39:43.756
The room we're in right now

39:43.839 --> 39:46.175
is on the left-end corner of the building.

39:46.717 --> 39:49.512
The clearing condition
is to leave this building.

39:50.179 --> 39:52.890
That's why we'd feel we should
choose the "Dead" door to lead us out.

39:52.973 --> 39:56.060
But as I recall, there is no gap
between this and the adjoining building.

39:56.143 --> 39:58.729
The "Alive" door will lead us
to where the high school girl died.

39:59.397 --> 40:02.233
I don't know why there's no door
to connect to the back of the building.

40:03.275 --> 40:04.777
I must have overlooked something,

40:04.860 --> 40:05.986
but what?

40:06.570 --> 40:09.490
There shouldn't be any space left
for them to create a trap.

40:10.241 --> 40:11.450
And if that's the case…

40:16.038 --> 40:18.290
We're wasting time! We're all gonna die!

40:18.374 --> 40:19.583
You haven't even opened a door!

40:19.667 --> 40:21.794
What are you even talking about?
Don't blame this on me!

40:21.877 --> 40:23.379
Stop it, you two!

40:23.462 --> 40:25.005
- Wait…
- Wait!

40:25.089 --> 40:27.216
Chota, you took a video of the first room!

40:27.299 --> 40:28.968
There's no time for that!

40:29.051 --> 40:30.636
Thirty seconds remaining.

40:30.719 --> 40:32.138
I could've missed something.

40:32.221 --> 40:33.556
…doors to an art gallery.

40:34.682 --> 40:36.475
Which door do you think it is?

40:39.145 --> 40:40.146
Ah, fuck!

40:40.771 --> 40:42.523
What'll happen if our time's up?

40:42.606 --> 40:44.233
I can't take it,
I can't breathe!

40:49.488 --> 40:51.282
- There's no door!
- Huh?

40:51.365 --> 40:53.409
There's no door in the room
the girl entered!

40:53.492 --> 40:54.577
- What does that mean?
- There's a door here!

40:54.660 --> 40:57.204
- Ten seconds remain.
- That means…

40:57.288 --> 40:58.873
The room the high-school girl died
isn't next to us!

40:58.956 --> 41:00.207
You mean what?

41:00.291 --> 41:01.959
There's another room on the other side!

41:02.042 --> 41:04.837
Three, two, one.

41:09.341 --> 41:12.970
The time limit for this room
is ten seconds.

41:13.053 --> 41:14.180
Ten seconds?

41:14.263 --> 41:15.639
Are you kidding?

41:15.723 --> 41:17.349
It's not "Alive"! It's "Dead"!

41:17.433 --> 41:19.143
Don't open it, it's a trap!

41:19.226 --> 41:20.895
Five, four,

41:20.978 --> 41:22.313
- three…
- Hurry!

41:22.396 --> 41:24.607
…two, one.

41:29.612 --> 41:32.281
Which way now?

41:32.364 --> 41:33.824
Head downstairs!

41:37.703 --> 41:39.288
C'mon, Chota. You can do it.

41:53.594 --> 41:55.346
Game cleared.

41:55.429 --> 41:56.263
GAME CLEARED

41:56.347 --> 41:57.556
Congratulations.

42:01.227 --> 42:03.395
It's all thanks to you.

42:05.231 --> 42:06.607
Thank you.

42:12.071 --> 42:13.405
It's my karma.

43:00.578 --> 43:04.081
To the survivors of the game,
we will now supply you with a visa.

43:04.164 --> 43:07.293
WE WILL SUPPLY ALL GAME SURVIVORS
WITH A 3-DAY VISA

43:08.168 --> 43:09.461
Visa?

43:23.767 --> 43:25.019
I'm going to

43:25.561 --> 43:26.979
drop out of the game!

43:29.481 --> 43:33.444
Listen. There's no end to the game,
no matter how much you clear.

43:37.114 --> 43:39.158
My visa just ended today.

43:40.868 --> 43:42.328
And now…

43:44.204 --> 43:45.998
I wish to play no longer.

43:55.549 --> 43:57.051
GM BUILDING

44:23.410 --> 44:24.787
When your visa expires,

44:25.704 --> 44:27.665
you must return to the game or…

44:29.917 --> 44:32.252
Our visas will end too.

44:33.379 --> 44:34.630
We've got three days.

44:35.130 --> 44:36.632
If you don't want to die,

44:37.341 --> 44:39.426
you'll have to continue playing the game.

45:45.576 --> 45:47.995
BASED ON THE ORIGINAL GRAPHIC NOVEL
ALICE IN BORDERLAND BY HARO ASO
